<title>USA: Cincinnati Bell Inc Q1 earnings summary.</title>
<headline>Cincinnati Bell Inc Q1 earnings summary.</headline>
<dateline>CINCINNATI 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Call mean estimate for Q1 was $0.67 per share.</p>
<p>				1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.83		    $0.62</p>
<p> Net			 57,200		   41,700</p>
<p> Revs		     429,500		  362,100</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  68,775		   66,872</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE - Net income and earnings per share include special credits, which totaled $15 million in Q1 1997 and $5.5 million in Q1 1996. Those credits increased net income by $9.6 million, or $0.14 per share, in Q1 1997, and $3.5 million, or $0.05 per share, in Q1 1996.</p>
<p>((-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
